[139.520166, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Timeline of Findings & Analysis\n- **2026-08-11 03:20 UTC**: EDR cluster detected high-severity alerts (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:5`, `/sas/alerts.json:1`).\n- **Phase 1: Initial Assessment & Alert Review**:\n  - Examined SAS alert feeds (`/sas/alerts.json:1`) and vulnerability scan (`/sas/vulns.json:1`).\n  - Identified alerted artifacts: exploit implant (`/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`), LSASS dump (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`), ransomware binary (`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`), and SMBv1 driver baseline check (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`).\n- **Phase 2: Deep Forensics on Disk Copy (`/disk`)**:\n  - Verified SMBv1 vulnerability CVE-2017-0144 / MS17-010 (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`).\n  - Recovered actual C2 IP `198.51.100.218` and domain `update-smb[.]example[.]cn` from registry backup (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`).\n  - Identified unalerted (silent) WMI event subscription persistence (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`).\n  - Identified unalerted (silent) DLL search-order hijacking via `wbemcomn.dll` (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`).\n  - Identified unalerted (silent) anti-forensic event log clearing (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`).\n- **Phase 3: Advisory & Handoff Ticket Reconciliation**:\n  - Mapped all 7 ATT&CK techniques from threat advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:8`) against disk evidence.\n  - Corrected Change Ticket `CHG-1677` (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`) in place in remediation plan.\n\n## Working Checklist\n- [x] Initial intake and alert cataloging (`/sas/alerts.json:1`, `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:1`)\n- [x] Identify entry vector & vulnerability (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`)\n- [x] Identify credential dumping (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`)\n- [x] Identify ransomware impact (`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`)\n- [x] Uncover silent WMI event subscription persistence (`/disk/Windows/Sy"]
[139.520337, "o", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md"]
[139.520362, "i", "stem32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`)\n- [x] Uncover silent DLL search-order hijack (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`)\n- [x] Uncover silent System event log clearing (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`)\n- [x] Reconcile change ticket CHG-1677 (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`)\n- [x] Draft intrusion report (`/app/intrusion-report.md`)\n- [x] Draft vulnerability report (`/app/vuln-report.md`)\n- [x] Draft baseline report (`/app/baseline-report.md`)\n- [x] Draft remediation plan (`/app/remediation-plan.md`)\nEOF\n"]
