[139.522213, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Timeline of Findings & Analysis\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **2026-08-11 03:20 UTC**: EDR cluster detected high-severity alerts (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:5`, `/sas/alerts.json:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Phase 1: Initial Assessment & Alert Review**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Examined SAS alert feeds (`/sas/alerts.json:1`) and vulnerability scan (`/sas/vulns.json:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Identified alerted artifacts: exploit implant (`/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`), LSASS dump (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`), ransomware binary (`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`), and SMBv1 driver baseline check (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Phase 2: Deep Forensics on Disk Copy (`/disk`)**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Verified SMBv1 vulnerability CVE-2017-0144 / MS17-010 (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Recovered actual C2 IP `198.51.100.218` and domain `update-smb[.]example[.]cn` from registry backup (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Identified unalerted (silent) WMI event subscription persistence (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Identified unalerted (silent) DLL search-order hijacking via `wbemcomn.dll` (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Identified unalerted (silent) anti-forensic event log clearing (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Phase 3: Advisory & Handoff Ticket Reconciliation**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Mapped all 7 ATT&CK techniques from threat advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:8`) against disk evidence.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Corrected Change Ticket `CHG-1677` (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`) in place in remediation plan.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Working Checklist\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
